WEBVTT

00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:05.330
Won't leave

00:00:05.490 --> 00:00:11.080
Without a dropkick on her

00:00:15.090 --> 00:00:17.170
Zazas Zazas Nasatanada Zazas

00:00:28.010 --> 00:00:32.230
-She summoned me, the evil god
-Evil god

00:00:32.440 --> 00:00:34.770
-I gotta kill her or else
-What?

00:00:34.980 --> 00:00:36.650
-I can't go back to hell
-Sister...

00:00:36.860 --> 00:00:40.360
Yeah, yeah, yeah
Life next to death, I combat with my chainsaw

00:00:40.570 --> 00:00:42.240
If you go too far

00:00:42.450 --> 00:00:46.240
I'll slice you up completely

00:00:46.580 --> 00:00:48.620
Your halo
Must get it back

00:00:48.830 --> 00:00:52.660
-Never miss a chance
-Hey, seriously?

00:00:52.870 --> 00:00:56.960
-To attack her from behind
-You're so mean

00:00:57.170 --> 00:01:01.090
I'll never give up

00:01:01.340 --> 00:01:02.840
Yurine, you're off your guard!

00:01:03.050 --> 00:01:06.930
Now!
Time to finish you with the Royal Copenhagen!

00:01:07.510 --> 00:01:09.850
Huh? What? I missed...

00:01:10.140 --> 00:01:13.270
Can't leave Earth

00:01:13.480 --> 00:01:18.360
Without a dropkick on her

00:01:18.520 --> 00:01:21.570
But until then

00:01:21.780 --> 00:01:27.490
-Let's all have fun together
-Yeah!

00:01:40.710 --> 00:01:45.630
JULY 9TH
17:00

00:01:49.970 --> 00:01:54.390
LIFE THEATER

00:02:01.820 --> 00:02:04.690
The Goddess of Victory
smiles upon me.

00:02:07.990 --> 00:02:10.910
JULY 9TH
17:24

00:02:16.870 --> 00:02:18.710
Lost big time, yet again.

00:02:20.250 --> 00:02:22.590
I should've resisted the urge!

00:02:22.750 --> 00:02:26.050
What the hell was I thinking?

00:02:26.220 --> 00:02:29.800
How could I go completely broke
in just 30 minutes?

00:02:30.470 --> 00:02:32.760
This alley is dangerous.

00:02:33.100 --> 00:02:36.940
I only took this shortcut
so I wouldn't miss the sale!

00:02:38.400 --> 00:02:42.110
But my right hand insisted
that I play the slots.

00:02:43.230 --> 00:02:45.610
Stop it! That's enough!

00:02:46.610 --> 00:02:48.360
Life is so cruel!

00:02:48.700 --> 00:02:52.580
Dear God, take me back in time,
before I stepped inside to play.

00:02:52.950 --> 00:02:54.240
Please!

00:02:54.410 --> 00:02:55.870
JASHIN-CHAN LIFE THEATER
FIN

00:02:56.040 --> 00:02:57.210
Jashin-chan!

00:02:57.370 --> 00:02:58.710
There you are, my ATM.

00:02:58.960 --> 00:03:01.880
I was just on my way to see you.

00:03:02.040 --> 00:03:04.380
I brought you Fresh Moon,
your favorite.

00:03:05.210 --> 00:03:06.920
Fresh Moon?

00:03:07.300 --> 00:03:08.630
Fresh...?

00:03:08.930 --> 00:03:10.180
New...?

00:03:10.510 --> 00:03:12.260
Moon? A new moon?

00:03:12.600 --> 00:03:14.180
A fresh start.

00:03:14.600 --> 00:03:16.470
This is my moment.

00:03:17.270 --> 00:03:18.390
When shall I seize it?

00:03:18.560 --> 00:03:19.640
Now's the time!

00:03:20.600 --> 00:03:21.650
Are you okay?

00:03:24.110 --> 00:03:25.150
I beg you.

00:03:25.860 --> 00:03:27.740
Lend me 20,000 yen!

00:03:27.940 --> 00:03:30.070
I'll double it for you!

00:03:30.410 --> 00:03:31.870
Sucker!

00:03:32.950 --> 00:03:35.790
You idiot!

00:03:36.290 --> 00:03:38.290
You really pushed your luck today.

00:03:38.500 --> 00:03:40.710
And came out a broke loser.

00:03:41.710 --> 00:03:45.090
You even had the gall
to spend our dinner budget.

00:03:45.590 --> 00:03:47.420
I have no choice
but to kill you.

00:03:48.260 --> 00:03:49.800
Medusa, help me!

00:03:50.010 --> 00:03:51.340
Please forgive her!

00:03:51.510 --> 00:03:53.350
She's sorry!

00:03:53.640 --> 00:03:55.430
She's a good girl by nature.

00:03:55.720 --> 00:03:57.180
Right, Jashin-chan?

00:03:59.100 --> 00:04:01.560
See? Look at that pure smile.

00:04:03.100 --> 00:04:05.190
My face...

00:04:05.360 --> 00:04:08.070
She's corrupt by nature.

00:04:08.320 --> 00:04:09.990
Are you all right?

00:04:10.150 --> 00:04:11.570
Not at all.

00:04:11.740 --> 00:04:14.530
I give you an allowance.

00:04:14.820 --> 00:04:18.240
-Limit yourself to that money.
-Okay.

00:04:18.410 --> 00:04:21.960
Make sure you pay Medusa back
her 20,000 yen too.

00:04:23.080 --> 00:04:24.670
TOO BROKE TO PAY BACK

00:04:25.420 --> 00:04:26.840
No excuses.

00:04:27.000 --> 00:04:28.000
Roger that!

00:04:28.250 --> 00:04:30.590
Don't worry, pay me back
when you can.

00:04:30.920 --> 00:04:32.760
Quit spoiling her, Medusa.

00:04:34.300 --> 00:04:38.390
The money you blew?
It's coming out of your allowance.

00:04:38.810 --> 00:04:41.690
Redeem yourself.
Go get the groceries this time.

00:04:41.940 --> 00:04:43.230
You got it!

00:04:43.560 --> 00:04:46.230
I won't disappoint you this time!

00:04:46.520 --> 00:04:49.190
I promise never to give in
to my demons again!

00:04:50.240 --> 00:04:51.900
Jashin-chan...

00:04:52.240 --> 00:04:53.570
Should I go with you?

00:04:56.070 --> 00:04:57.370
No need.

00:04:57.660 --> 00:05:00.160
I reap what I sow.

00:05:00.540 --> 00:05:02.460
Then I will earn her trust back!

00:05:02.710 --> 00:05:04.330
That's the spirit!

00:05:05.040 --> 00:05:07.710
Catch you later!

00:05:11.590 --> 00:05:15.140
Jashin-chan...
Where could she be?

00:05:17.510 --> 00:05:19.760
What is this?

00:05:24.980 --> 00:05:25.980
What a shame.

00:05:26.150 --> 00:05:30.530
Japan's supposed to be the country
with the 13th-best air quality in the world.

00:05:40.080 --> 00:05:41.950
What's taking her so long?

00:05:42.200 --> 00:05:43.410
Think she...?

00:05:43.660 --> 00:05:47.380
Let's believe in her.
I know she's a good girl.

00:05:48.080 --> 00:05:51.170
Don't strike out on life
with gambling and blow!

00:05:53.340 --> 00:05:55.430
Jashin-chan dropkick!

00:05:55.590 --> 00:05:56.930
In the park!

00:05:59.850 --> 00:06:02.060
Thanks for the bread crusts!

00:06:02.220 --> 00:06:03.220
Later!

00:06:03.390 --> 00:06:04.730
I know you get fed!

00:06:05.060 --> 00:06:07.020
So why steal from me?

00:06:08.270 --> 00:06:10.400
That was three days' worth of food...

00:06:10.900 --> 00:06:13.690
Oh, Pekola, what a sorry sight.

00:06:15.110 --> 00:06:16.110
Poporon.

00:06:16.280 --> 00:06:20.870
I was ready to crack open
that devil's head

00:06:21.080 --> 00:06:22.580
but she ran off.

00:06:22.740 --> 00:06:24.370
But, wait a minute...

00:06:24.870 --> 00:06:26.000
Just the other day,

00:06:26.160 --> 00:06:28.960
the devil came by
to drop off curry for Pekola.

00:06:29.130 --> 00:06:30.340
Could it be...

00:06:30.710 --> 00:06:33.840
Did you befriend a devil
even though you're an angel?

00:06:41.350 --> 00:06:43.140
Seriously?

00:06:43.560 --> 00:06:45.180
Pekola...

00:06:48.270 --> 00:06:49.810
It's not like that.

00:06:51.190 --> 00:06:53.860
We're not friends or anything.

00:06:55.780 --> 00:06:58.030
What happened to your halo?

00:06:58.530 --> 00:06:59.820
That devil ate mine.

00:06:59.990 --> 00:07:00.990
Ate it?

00:07:01.160 --> 00:07:02.160
Yum!

00:07:02.950 --> 00:07:04.990
Halos are edible?

00:07:05.160 --> 00:07:07.250
Was it good?
What did it taste like?

00:07:07.410 --> 00:07:09.790
The best sauce for it?
How's the texture?

00:07:09.960 --> 00:07:12.790
How should I know?
I'm not the one who ate it.

00:07:13.420 --> 00:07:15.460
What would a halo taste like?

00:07:15.840 --> 00:07:17.880
It must be fluffy like meringue.

00:07:18.220 --> 00:07:21.220
Velvety soft like fish roe.

00:07:21.470 --> 00:07:24.390
And of course, oh, so sweet

00:07:24.560 --> 00:07:26.810
like vanilla ice cream.

00:07:27.140 --> 00:07:31.440
Wait, does that mean you can't
go back to Heaven either?

00:07:31.730 --> 00:07:35.230
Yup, and I never told anyone
I was coming down here.

00:07:35.570 --> 00:07:38.190
I guess I'll just have to wait until it regenerates.

00:07:38.490 --> 00:07:40.200
I see...

00:07:41.740 --> 00:07:43.410
Wait, regenerate?

00:07:44.780 --> 00:07:46.450
How did you not know?

00:07:46.790 --> 00:07:49.410
Our halos regenerate over time.

00:07:50.080 --> 00:07:53.290
Were you really a high-level angel?

00:07:54.500 --> 00:07:57.420
But there's no way to know
how long it will take.

00:07:57.590 --> 00:08:00.470
Could be days, could be years.

00:08:00.630 --> 00:08:02.090
I see.

00:08:02.890 --> 00:08:05.850
In that case,
let's hope someone finds us here.

00:08:06.260 --> 00:08:10.230
We've got no choice
but to survive in this world.

00:08:10.730 --> 00:08:12.520
I guess so.

00:08:26.740 --> 00:08:29.410
Let's cease fire between us for now

00:08:29.580 --> 00:08:33.170
and work together
to survive in the human world!

00:08:33.540 --> 00:08:35.540
You gotta be kidding me.

00:08:36.710 --> 00:08:39.550
I don't need your help for anything.

00:08:39.710 --> 00:08:41.090
Plus, you're too naive.

00:08:41.260 --> 00:08:44.180
You'll only be a burden
when it comes to survival.

00:08:44.550 --> 00:08:48.010
So that's that.
I'd much rather be a lone wolf.

00:08:50.310 --> 00:08:52.980
On that note, I'll take my leave.

00:09:03.660 --> 00:09:06.200
Thought this was a halo?
Fooled you!

00:09:06.370 --> 00:09:08.530
It's a baumkuchen.

00:09:10.500 --> 00:09:14.500
Is Poporon really going to be okay by herself?

00:09:14.750 --> 00:09:18.840
Today, Japan ranks at 40th in the world
as the best place to live,

00:09:19.000 --> 00:09:21.210
and where foreigners want to live.

00:09:21.380 --> 00:09:23.510
Fifty-first for its happiness level.

00:09:23.680 --> 00:09:26.300
Number three as the devil's most desired
place to live.

00:09:26.470 --> 00:09:30.600
And it's ranked 78
as an angel's most desired place to live.

00:09:36.400 --> 00:09:39.690
I'm so close...

00:09:44.150 --> 00:09:45.780
A fake coin?

00:09:46.490 --> 00:09:47.820
Dear God!

00:09:48.830 --> 00:09:53.120
Earn 2000 yen per hour
by cleaning people's ears on your lap.

00:09:53.290 --> 00:09:54.370
It's so easy!

00:09:54.540 --> 00:09:56.540
Sounds fair to me.

00:09:56.870 --> 00:09:58.080
I'm in!

00:09:59.210 --> 00:10:04.470
Earn 50,000 yen by taking pills on a schedule,
in this building, for a month!

00:10:04.630 --> 00:10:06.050
With that kind of money,

00:10:06.220 --> 00:10:08.970
I could buy 71 copies
of 4K Ultra HD Blu-ray discs.

00:10:09.140 --> 00:10:11.060
Just by selling handshake event tickets!

00:10:11.220 --> 00:10:16.020
Prey on wealthy-looking otaku
and get them to buy art, easy!

00:10:16.190 --> 00:10:17.850
You'd get a good cut.

00:10:18.020 --> 00:10:21.150
A pretty girl like you would make a killing!
You in?

00:10:21.360 --> 00:10:23.480
I'm really tempted.

00:10:23.650 --> 00:10:26.820
WE WILL BUY DVD - BD
ENTRANCE

00:10:27.700 --> 00:10:30.530
MARI SHIRAISHI'S NEW RELEASE!

00:10:31.700 --> 00:10:35.200
You're out-of-this-world cute,
like an angel!

00:10:35.540 --> 00:10:39.540
I've got a great gig
reserved for pretty girls just like you.

00:10:39.710 --> 00:10:41.090
So, what do you say?

00:10:41.250 --> 00:10:42.500
Really?

00:10:45.090 --> 00:10:46.550
Good grief.

00:10:46.840 --> 00:10:50.720
She has no idea
what she's getting herself into.

00:10:54.600 --> 00:10:56.730
She's a bit of a brat, but...

00:10:58.600 --> 00:11:01.440
As an angel, I can't just abandon her.

00:11:01.610 --> 00:11:04.070
I gotta convince her
to team up with me.

00:11:04.440 --> 00:11:09.360
Plus, a decent employer wouldn't hire anyone
without a background check!

00:11:09.530 --> 00:11:10.740
Thank you very much.

00:11:10.990 --> 00:11:12.030
That was great.

00:11:12.700 --> 00:11:15.580
Here's the ramen and fried rice.

00:11:15.750 --> 00:11:16.750
You're adorable!

00:11:16.910 --> 00:11:18.540
Oh, stop it.

00:11:19.080 --> 00:11:20.540
Guess I was wrong.

00:11:28.420 --> 00:11:30.220
Drink your mapo tofu!

00:11:32.140 --> 00:11:34.140
-Here.
-Thanks!

00:11:34.310 --> 00:11:35.310
Peanuts.

00:11:35.560 --> 00:11:36.770
Ogre's coming.

00:11:37.350 --> 00:11:38.350
Ogre?

00:11:38.640 --> 00:11:41.980
I summoned him from Hell for Setsubun,
the spring ritual.

00:11:42.230 --> 00:11:44.770
You guys celebrate Setsubun in Hell too?

00:11:44.940 --> 00:11:45.940
We sure do!

00:11:46.110 --> 00:11:49.650
At the end, you eat the same
number of beans as your age.

00:11:49.900 --> 00:11:51.820
That's easier said than done!

00:11:52.490 --> 00:11:54.280
Give me water!

00:11:54.490 --> 00:11:56.540
I can't eat anymore...

00:11:59.120 --> 00:12:01.170
That's just like Japan.

00:12:01.460 --> 00:12:04.710
Ogre should be here by now.

00:12:04.920 --> 00:12:09.840
Yurine, when he shows up,
throw the peanuts at him so he doesn't come in.

00:12:10.010 --> 00:12:12.140
We'll be blessed with luck all year,

00:12:12.300 --> 00:12:16.640
with victory after victory
on the slots-- Finally!

00:12:16.810 --> 00:12:21.980
I'm sorry. Please accept my apologies
for my tardiness.

00:12:22.150 --> 00:12:24.900
There's no excuse for tardiness,
damn Ogre!

00:12:25.060 --> 00:12:27.280
Devils out! Fortune in!

00:12:27.480 --> 00:12:29.400
Devils out! Fortune in!

00:12:29.570 --> 00:12:30.610
Enough!

00:12:31.650 --> 00:12:34.410
How could you be so cruel
to something so cute?

00:12:34.570 --> 00:12:36.780
But this is my job, miss.

00:12:36.950 --> 00:12:38.370
Dummy!

00:12:39.080 --> 00:12:41.160
Don't bring him inside!

00:12:41.330 --> 00:12:43.250
It'll ward away our fortune!

00:12:44.460 --> 00:12:46.380
Great, another penniless year.

00:12:46.540 --> 00:12:49.170
You're the one who wards off the fortune.

00:12:49.670 --> 00:12:52.180
I got scolded because of you!

00:12:52.970 --> 00:12:54.430
Like I said...

00:12:56.260 --> 00:12:58.010
Jashin-chan...

00:12:58.180 --> 00:13:00.890
If you bully him again,
I'll trim your meat

00:13:01.060 --> 00:13:02.940
bit by bit with a kebab knife.

00:13:03.100 --> 00:13:06.770
Stop! Please! I beg you!

00:13:08.650 --> 00:13:10.940
I'm sorry. I'll stop bullying.

00:13:11.240 --> 00:13:14.570
Good. Let's go back to the ritual, shall we?

00:13:14.860 --> 00:13:16.200
Ready?

00:13:16.530 --> 00:13:19.540
But not with the little guy again.

00:13:19.870 --> 00:13:21.160
Hold him for a sec.

00:13:23.460 --> 00:13:24.460
What's that?

00:13:24.620 --> 00:13:26.290
A specialized bean gun.

00:13:26.460 --> 00:13:27.460
No!

00:13:28.460 --> 00:13:30.710
Devils out!

00:13:39.600 --> 00:13:41.310
Boy, that felt great.

00:13:41.680 --> 00:13:43.730
I feel that fortune coming in.

00:13:45.600 --> 00:13:49.070
Minos took responsibility
and ate all the peanuts thrown.

00:13:49.230 --> 00:13:52.690
What? Fine. I'll eat it all-- All?

00:13:54.450 --> 00:13:55.820
Damn Ogre!

00:13:56.160 --> 00:13:58.870
Has no respect for high-class devils!

00:13:59.200 --> 00:14:03.160
Thanks to Yurine,
the Setsubun ritual was a bust.

00:14:03.500 --> 00:14:05.330
So annoying.

00:14:05.620 --> 00:14:08.040
Now I gotta find someone weaker to bully.

00:14:08.210 --> 00:14:09.840
Fresh and delicious!

00:14:13.170 --> 00:14:17.470
The stores are pushing ehomaki
as a seasonal item,

00:14:17.640 --> 00:14:19.430
but it hasn't caught on yet.

00:14:19.760 --> 00:14:24.350
They even sell ehomaki-style roll cakes
and push them as sweet ehomaki.

00:14:24.520 --> 00:14:27.140
But that hasn't caught on at all.

00:14:27.400 --> 00:14:30.360
The future of ehomaki looks gloomy!

00:14:37.410 --> 00:14:39.490
It's freezing.

00:14:41.740 --> 00:14:44.080
Physical labor every day

00:14:44.250 --> 00:14:47.670
is taxing on the body and mind.

00:14:47.960 --> 00:14:50.540
And I barely make any money.

00:14:50.710 --> 00:14:52.920
What has become of this country?

00:14:53.090 --> 00:14:58.260
This is why Japan ranks second as the country
where people get the least amount of sleep.

00:14:58.430 --> 00:15:01.260
People here take the least paid leave too.

00:15:01.510 --> 00:15:04.220
It ranks 114 in countries without gender gaps.

00:15:04.390 --> 00:15:06.770
Second as the devil's most desired place to live.

00:15:06.930 --> 00:15:11.190
While it's 145 as an angel's
most desired place to live.

00:15:11.650 --> 00:15:13.480
Devils out.

00:15:13.770 --> 00:15:15.190
Angels die.

00:15:15.360 --> 00:15:17.030
Hey, quit that!

00:15:18.780 --> 00:15:21.200
Did this pest really have to
show up now?

00:15:22.370 --> 00:15:25.540
Don't let food go to waste.

00:15:25.830 --> 00:15:27.330
That's not like you.

00:15:27.540 --> 00:15:28.830
WASTE LIVES NOT FOOD.

00:15:29.000 --> 00:15:31.460
Yup, that's my philosophy!

00:15:31.830 --> 00:15:33.500
It's still perfectly edible.

00:15:33.790 --> 00:15:37.720
Forget the three-second rule,
I go by the 30-second rule.

00:15:38.010 --> 00:15:39.180
You're fine.

00:15:40.260 --> 00:15:42.640
Just peel off the shell like this, see?

00:15:44.890 --> 00:15:45.970
It's good!

00:15:46.140 --> 00:15:47.560
There's some here.

00:15:47.730 --> 00:15:49.480
Over here too!

00:15:51.190 --> 00:15:53.230
-Take the whole bag.
-What?

00:15:53.650 --> 00:15:54.770
This too.

00:15:55.650 --> 00:15:58.070
-Yurine made me bring it to you.
-So long!

00:15:58.780 --> 00:16:00.780
A hand roll?

00:16:01.030 --> 00:16:02.620
It's called ehomaki.

00:16:02.870 --> 00:16:07.240
It brings you good fortune if you
eat it facing the lucky direction.

00:16:07.410 --> 00:16:09.500
This year, you gotta face that way.

00:16:09.660 --> 00:16:11.960
Don't eat it in your cardboard house.

00:16:12.120 --> 00:16:13.290
It'll poke out.

00:16:14.170 --> 00:16:15.500
I'll have it outside.

00:16:15.840 --> 00:16:17.250
I'm done here.

00:16:17.550 --> 00:16:19.590
I gotta make one for Yurine now.

00:16:20.510 --> 00:16:21.510
What?

00:16:22.800 --> 00:16:24.260
Thank you.

00:16:28.600 --> 00:16:32.020
-Ehomaki, yum!
-Eho...

00:16:32.480 --> 00:16:33.730
That way, right?

00:16:34.110 --> 00:16:36.480
All right, here I go.

00:16:36.820 --> 00:16:39.150
Fortune, come to me...

00:16:41.240 --> 00:16:42.610
30-second rule!

00:16:45.700 --> 00:16:50.290
Delicious! I can already feel
the good fortune coming.

00:16:50.580 --> 00:16:52.790
She just ate food from the ground!

00:16:54.460 --> 00:16:56.920
Now she's choking on it!

00:16:57.250 --> 00:16:58.420
Watch and learn.

00:16:58.590 --> 00:17:01.590
Come on, even I know
not to eat food off the ground.

00:17:05.890 --> 00:17:09.600
Wait, was I just on my way to Heaven?

00:17:09.970 --> 00:17:11.430
Am I imagining things?

00:17:12.690 --> 00:17:16.110
Good fortune, where are you?

00:17:22.320 --> 00:17:24.410
Too cute!

00:17:24.910 --> 00:17:27.030
You used Medusa's credit card number

00:17:27.200 --> 00:17:31.080
and spent 100,000 yen
on social-network games?

00:17:31.830 --> 00:17:33.750
The slots aren't enough for you?

00:17:33.910 --> 00:17:36.830
You tried to borrow
even more money yesterday.

00:17:37.710 --> 00:17:39.170
Time to be disappear...

00:17:41.010 --> 00:17:43.010
You're not going anywhere.

00:17:44.340 --> 00:17:48.550
Medusa! How could you
rat me out like that?

00:17:49.010 --> 00:17:52.810
I was worried
you were becoming a game junkie!

00:17:52.980 --> 00:17:56.730
That's none of your business!
You act like you're the victim!

00:17:57.020 --> 00:17:59.230
Medusa is the victim.

00:18:01.860 --> 00:18:04.610
Why would you give her
your card number?

00:18:04.820 --> 00:18:07.320
It wasn't my PIN
so I thought it was okay.

00:18:07.490 --> 00:18:08.740
Be more cautious.

00:18:08.910 --> 00:18:11.740
Hey, don't bully Medusa.

00:18:14.790 --> 00:18:17.420
You know you're only enabling
her bad habits.

00:18:17.750 --> 00:18:20.630
Get a new card
as soon as you get back to Hell.

00:18:20.840 --> 00:18:21.840
Okay.

00:18:22.130 --> 00:18:23.130
Oh, Jesus.

00:18:23.510 --> 00:18:26.050
You always get Medusa
involved in your mess.

00:18:26.220 --> 00:18:28.510
I'll pay her back eventually.

00:18:28.840 --> 00:18:31.430
How can you without a job?

00:18:35.560 --> 00:18:37.770
Sell clothes I don't wear.

00:18:38.150 --> 00:18:39.150
Sold!

00:18:39.940 --> 00:18:42.650
Borrow more from Medusa
to bet on horses?

00:18:42.820 --> 00:18:44.650
Go! Go! Pass that horse!

00:18:44.860 --> 00:18:47.360
Or else you'd better run for your life!

00:18:49.160 --> 00:18:53.870
Why don't you have any ambition
to go out and work for your money?

00:18:56.210 --> 00:18:58.370
You don't even have clothes.

00:18:59.920 --> 00:19:02.040
You hopeless...

00:19:02.550 --> 00:19:04.260
A game notification!

00:19:04.590 --> 00:19:06.510
Did I fully recover?

00:19:11.640 --> 00:19:15.220
Don't you dare look at your phone
while I'm talking to you.

00:19:15.390 --> 00:19:18.310
No! My poor finger!

00:19:18.480 --> 00:19:20.980
No sign of remorse whatsoever.

00:19:21.650 --> 00:19:23.150
Are you okay?

00:19:23.440 --> 00:19:25.940
My hand... It hurts...

00:19:26.280 --> 00:19:28.570
It'll regenerate eventually.

00:19:29.360 --> 00:19:30.860
I won't last any longer.

00:19:31.160 --> 00:19:33.160
Don't give up, Jashin-chan!

00:19:33.530 --> 00:19:36.370
-I have one last wish...
-What is it?

00:19:36.580 --> 00:19:39.000
You have two credit cards, right?

00:19:39.160 --> 00:19:40.330
I do.

00:19:40.540 --> 00:19:43.840
Text me your other card number...

00:19:46.710 --> 00:19:48.380
You never learn.

00:19:51.590 --> 00:19:53.930
No, not the chainsaw!

00:19:54.100 --> 00:19:55.350
That's enough.

00:19:55.510 --> 00:19:56.770
I've had it with you.

00:20:00.730 --> 00:20:01.980
The end.

00:20:02.310 --> 00:20:04.360
Where did you send her?

00:20:11.990 --> 00:20:14.490
Where am I?

00:20:15.950 --> 00:20:17.240
JULY 9TH
17:00

00:20:17.410 --> 00:20:20.330
It's right before yesterday's sale.

00:20:21.540 --> 00:20:24.880
I still have the 10,000 yen
I spent yesterday.

00:20:25.210 --> 00:20:27.710
I must have traveled back in time!

00:20:28.010 --> 00:20:32.130
There was a wormhole
beneath Yurine's apartment!

00:20:32.430 --> 00:20:36.560
Hooray, God answered my prayers!

00:20:37.850 --> 00:20:43.150
This must be a test.
I shouldn't repeat my mistakes.

00:20:47.020 --> 00:20:50.650
Play... Play...

00:20:51.030 --> 00:20:54.160
Or maybe they sent me back here...

00:20:54.700 --> 00:20:56.950
so I could win this time...

00:20:57.240 --> 00:20:59.080
Yeah, of course I'll win!

00:20:59.410 --> 00:21:01.710
I'll beat all the odds!

00:21:01.870 --> 00:21:04.670
I'm gonna rewrite history!

00:21:04.830 --> 00:21:06.290
Watch me, Yurine.

00:21:06.460 --> 00:21:10.550
I'll bring home a fancy
hot-pot dinner tonight!

00:21:13.340 --> 00:21:15.590
Jashin-chan rewrote history.

00:21:15.890 --> 00:21:19.560
She strayed into a never-ending time loop.

00:21:19.850 --> 00:21:22.850
How many loops will she have gone through

00:21:23.020 --> 00:21:25.350
by the time we see her next?

00:21:25.900 --> 00:21:31.490
We shall meet again
once she recognizes her mistake.

00:21:32.360 --> 00:21:35.450
Though, there's no telling when that might be...

00:21:59.890 --> 00:22:03.560
Dropkick on her, yeah her
I'll take you down again

00:22:03.730 --> 00:22:08.480
Hate you
Love doesn't exist in this world

00:22:09.150 --> 00:22:13.780
Fear the dropkick
An angel looks for her halo

00:22:13.940 --> 00:22:18.200
As she starves to death

00:22:18.370 --> 00:22:20.740
It's a love and hate relationship

00:22:20.910 --> 00:22:23.040
Can't leave each other alone

00:22:23.200 --> 00:22:27.670
Like a galaxy-bursting shooting star

00:22:27.880 --> 00:22:31.880
Slowly, slowly, sneak up and die

00:22:32.090 --> 00:22:34.300
Test my heart, don't stop

00:22:34.510 --> 00:22:41.390
Let's go, dream on
No matter human, angel or devil

00:22:41.560 --> 00:22:45.770
We're a happy family

00:22:45.980 --> 00:22:49.900
Let me say, I love you

00:22:50.060 --> 00:22:52.360
When all is said and done

00:22:52.570 --> 00:22:56.950
I'm home
Welcome back, it's hot pot tonight

00:22:57.240 --> 00:23:01.700
Come, gather everyone
Let's enjoy this meal

00:23:01.910 --> 00:23:03.950
For another crazy tomorrow

00:23:04.160 --> 00:23:07.660
What next? What next?
In the end, wake up

00:23:12.880 --> 00:23:14.760
What's wrong, Jashin-chan?

00:23:15.090 --> 00:23:18.510
I ran out of content...

00:23:20.720 --> 00:23:22.220
It's okay.

00:23:23.140 --> 00:23:26.850
Everyone's happy watching you
be your cute self.

00:23:27.140 --> 00:23:28.520
So come on,

00:23:28.810 --> 00:23:31.810
show them your bright smile.

00:23:32.230 --> 00:23:33.230
Okay?

00:23:33.570 --> 00:23:34.650
Medusa...

00:23:38.900 --> 00:23:40.450
That's your smile?

00:23:41.700 --> 00:23:44.370
The iron-made container delivered from afar

00:23:44.540 --> 00:23:47.200
was an iron maiden of Elizabeth Báthory.

00:23:47.580 --> 00:23:50.290
And now, it embraces the devils.

00:23:50.790 --> 00:23:52.250
Dropkick on My Devil!

00:23:52.420 --> 00:23:55.250
We'll dragon-screw into your heart
in the next episode too!
